This repository contains two bodies of work with different copyright status:

  1. ORIGINAL WORK OF THIS REPOSITORY — covered by the MIT license below.
     The orca geometry (orcaHalfWidth, flukes, paddle, patch, saddle), all of the
     DeepSeek Harness plugin wiring (src/entry.ts, src/surface.tsx,
     src/settings-row.tsx, src/store.ts, src/index.ts), the light/dark theme
     adaptation, whole-canvas opacity, the whale tail beat, the build scripts and
     the preview pages.

  2. PORTED WORK — NOT covered by this license.
     The schooling simulation, predator steering, cell rasteriser and shark
     silhouettes are derived from https://github.com/stackedlol/ascii-sharks,
     which ships with no license file at the time of writing. Copyright in that
     work remains with its author(s). See NOTICE.md.

If you redistribute this repository, or anything derived from it, carry both this
file and NOTICE.md with it.

